<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA50C0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA5320"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA5580"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA57E0" style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA5A40" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA5CA0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA5F00"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA6160" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA63C0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA6620"><tr width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA6880"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA6AE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA6D40" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA7330" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Earn Points. Save on Flights. Manage Travel</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA76C0" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA83C0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA8620"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA8880"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA8AE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/QBR_eDM_Banner.jpg" title="Qantas Business Rewards" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA9670"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA98D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/images/qbr-travel-fund-hero-680x400.png" style="width: 680px;"></font></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAA480" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAA6E0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAA940"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAABA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAB050"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAB2B0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAB510"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAB770" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BABFA0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAC200" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAC6C0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAC920" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BACDE0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAD040" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">It was great to speak to you earlier. As discussed, we are very excited to have launched Travel Fund, which is a new feature allowing you to store and combine the value from flights you need to cancel or change, in your Business Account. Use it instantly as a payment option, for anyone in your business, on any eligible flight.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BA8E70"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAD2A0">Look for Travel Fund amongst your cancellations options the next time your travel plans change and enjoy more choice, flexibility, and control. It consolidates eligible flight bookings into a single balance that can be used for any traveller in your business – without the need to juggle multiple flight credits or track individual bookings.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAD4E0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAD740" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BADE50"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAE0B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAE310"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAE570"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAE7D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAEA30"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAEC90"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAEEF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-dollar.png" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAF3A0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAFAA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BAFF60"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BB03F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BB0650"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BB08B0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BB0B10" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BB0D70">A single balance</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BB1100">Select Travel Fund to store the value of flights in a single, combined balance when you need to change or cancel a flight.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BB1F10"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011BB2170" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157231B0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015723410" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" height="50px" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015723670"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157238D0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015723B30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015723D90"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015723FF0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015724250" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; height: 50px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/people-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015724700" style="margin: 0px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015724E00" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157252C0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015725750" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157259B0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015725C10"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015725E70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157260D0">Book for any traveller</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015726460">No passenger restrictions – use your funds for any flight, any traveller in your business, any time.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015727270"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157274D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015727BE0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015727E40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157280A0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015728300"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015728560" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157287C0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015728A20"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015728C80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/payment-cards-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015729130" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015729830" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015729CF0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572A180" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572A3E0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572A640"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572A8A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572AB00">Split Payments</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572AE90">Enjoy the flexibility to split payment across Travel Fund and your credit card.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572BEF0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572C150" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572C610"></font><hr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572C720" style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572CE10"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572D070" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><h3 data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572D2D0" style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br>How it works</font></h3></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572DB10"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572DD70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572DFD0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572E230"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572E490" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572E6F0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572E950"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572EBB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-laptop.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572F060" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572F760" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001572FC20"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157300B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015730310"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015730570"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157307D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015730A30">Access Travel Fund</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015730DC0">Log into your Business Account and go to&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/manageusers" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015731000" style="color: rgb(223, 0, 0); border: 0px;">Manage Users</a>&nbsp;to view all users with access to your Account and their Permission level. ‘Full Access’ users automatically have access to book with and cancel to Travel Fund. For any ‘Limited Access’ users you will need to select to provide access to book and/or cancel to Travel Fund. You can now also set up users with ‘Self-Booking Only’ access.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015731F60"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157321C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157328D0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015736BF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" height="50px" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015736E50"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157370B0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015737310" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015737570"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157377D0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015737A30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; height: 50px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/dollar-icon-2.png" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015737EE0" style="margin: 0px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157385E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015738AA0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015738F30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015739190"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157393F0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015739650" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157398B0">Book with Travel Fund</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015739C40">When booking your next flight, select Travel Fund as your preferred payment method on the checkout page. You can also add paid seat selection to your booking in the same transaction.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573AA50"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573ACB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573B3C0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573B620" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573B880"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573BAE0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573BD40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573BFA0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573C200"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573C460" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/cancel-fee-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573C910" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573D010" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573D4D0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573D960" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573DBC0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573DE20"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573E080" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573E2E0">Cancel to Travel Fund</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573E670">Log into your Business Account and go to&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/obt/company-trips" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573E8B0" style="color: rgb(223, 0, 0); border: 0px;">Manage Trips</a>. Select the trip you would like to cancel and select the ‘cancel’ option. Select Travel Fund as your preferred cancellation option. Funds will be credited instantly to your Trave Fund Balance.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573F810"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001573FA70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015740180"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157403E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015740640"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157408A0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015740B00" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015740D60"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015740FC0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015741220" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/news-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157416D0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015741DD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015742290"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015742720" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015742980"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015742BE0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015742E40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157430A0">View transaction history</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015743430">View your entire Travel Fund transaction history via your Business Account. Users with the required permissions for Travel Fund can view the balance and transaction history.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015744240"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157444A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015744960"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015744BC0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">You can find more information by visiting our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/manage-travel/travel-fund.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015744E20" style="color: rgb(223, 0, 0); border: 0px;">Travel Fund</a>&nbsp;page.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157451B0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157452C0">Ready to get started?&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/myaccount" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015745500" style="color: rgb(223, 0, 0); border: 0px;">Log in</a>&nbsp;to your Business Account to start using Travel Fund today!<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015745890"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157459A0">Don’t forget that the more you fly, the more you save! Be sure to include both your ABN and the traveller’s Qantas Frequent Flyer number into every booking to ensure your business earns 80,000 business Qantas Points from flights per year to retain Level 3.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015745BE0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015745CF0">If you have any questions regarding Travel Fund or would like further information, please feel free to contact me directly on 13 10 85, or the Qantas Business Rewards Priority line on 13&nbsp;74&nbsp;78. I look forward to speaking with you again soon.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157463F0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015746500">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015746740"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015746850"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015746A90">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015798180">Account Representative<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157983C0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015798600">Qantas Business Rewards</em></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015798BF0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015798E50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015799310"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015799570" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001579ABC0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001579AE20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001579B080" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001579B2E0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001579B540"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001579B7A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001579BA00" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_li