00157A3930"><td border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A3B90" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To unsubscribe from Qantas marketing offers, contact your Account Manager&nbsp;<a href="mailto:?subject=Unsubscribe%20from%20Qantas%20marketing%20offers" target="_blank" title="Unsubscribe" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A3DF0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">here</a>&nbsp;to unsubscribe.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A43E0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A4640" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font><hr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A49D0" style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A5C90"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A5EF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A6150" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A63B0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A6610" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A6870" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A6AD0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A6D30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 14px; height: 14px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A70C0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A7320" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 14px; height: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Important information</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A77E0"><td class="height_five" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157A7A40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 5px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 5px; height: 5px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D24F0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D2750" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D29B0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246); margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D2C10"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D2E70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D30D0" style="margin: 0px 40px; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D3330"><td class="t_c" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D3590" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Use of Travel Fund is subject to&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/terms-and-conditions.html#travelfund" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D37F0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D3B80"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D3C90">A business must be a Qantas Business Rewards Member to earn Qantas Points for the business. Qantas Points are offered under the applicable partner's terms and conditions and earning thresholds may apply. Membership of Qantas Business Rewards and the earning of Qantas Points as a business are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/terms-and-conditions.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D3ED0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards Terms and Conditions</a>.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D44C0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D4720" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D4BE0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000157D4E40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
